                                        "entry_id": "ca31f34a-7380-38fb-b885-99f38528a2db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A serologic test: a blood test to detect the presence of, and often to measure the amount of, various components of the serum (usually antibodies, antigens, and immune complexes thereof)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "proscribed",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
